#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""V9 a126-a135 authored extension. Shared bilingual schema from group B core."""
import importlib.util, json, ast
from pathlib import Path
spec=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location('v9b_builder',Path(__file__).with_name('build_group_b.py'))
b=importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec);spec.loader.exec_module(b)
b.DATA.clear()
course=b.course

course(126,'架構與層疊~Architecture and stack-up|介電與佈線~Dielectrics and routing|翹曲與介面~Warpage and interfaces|整合與驗收~Integration and acceptance','有機中介層 RDL、回流與機械順應性~Organic-interposer RDL, returns and mechanical compliance','有機中介層不是單一材料或通用製程；公開 CoWoS-R 案例僅示範架構，尺寸與可靠度資料不得外推全部供應商。~Organic interposers are not one material or universal process; public CoWoS-R examples illustrate architecture, not universal geometry or reliability.','假設銅線長 5 mm、寬 10 μm、厚 5 μm、ρ=1.7×10⁻⁸ Ωm，R=ρL/(wt)=1.7 Ω；0.1 A 時 DC 壓降 0.17 V。窄線溫升、接點及 AC 效應尚未計入。~For hypothetical copper length 5 mm, width 10 μm, thickness 5 μm and ρ=1.7×10⁻⁸ Ωm, R=1.7 Ω; at 0.1 A DC drop is 0.17 V. Heating, contacts and AC effects are excluded.','有機材料柔軟所以沒有熱應力~Organic compliance eliminates all thermal stress|RDL 線距夠小就保證高速訊號完整性~Fine RDL spacing guarantees high-speed integrity',['tsmc-cowos','tsmc-organic','ti-pdn'],[('a125','跨晶粒佈線與供電規劃可以比較~Cross-die routing and power planning are comparable','矽與聚合物的 CTE、損耗和剛性不同~Silicon and polymer differ in CTE, loss and stiffness'),('a128','都使用介電增層與銅互連~Both use dielectric build-up and copper interconnects','ABF 基板與薄 RDL 中介層不是相同層級~An ABF substrate and thin RDL interposer occupy different integration levels')],r'''
劃分晶粒與中介層~Partition dies and interposer|中介層把高密度晶粒互連轉接到較大尺度封裝，需定義兩端焊墊。~An interposer translates dense die connections to package scale; both pad interfaces need definition.|畫出晶粒、RDL、C4 及基板的層次。~Draw die, RDL, C4 and substrate levels.
設定層疊與回流~Set stack-up and returns|每條高速訊號需要連續回流，不能只有信號層而無參考。~Every fast signal needs a continuous return, not only a signal layer.|標每層信號與接地用途。~Label signal and ground roles for each layer.
分配逃線區域~Allocate escape routing|焊墊陣列、過孔與線距共同限制可佈線性。~Pad arrays, vias and spacing jointly limit routability.|選一個晶粒角落完整逃線至中介層邊緣。~Route one die corner fully to the interposer edge.
選擇介電材料~Select dielectric materials|介電常數、損耗、吸濕與 CTE 是不同設計變數。~Permittivity, loss, moisture uptake and CTE are distinct variables.|建立電性與機械性能雙表。~Build separate electrical and mechanical property tables.
估算銅線電阻~Estimate copper resistance|窄長 RDL 可有顯著 DC 壓降，即使晶粒間距看似很短。~Long narrow RDL can create appreciable DC drop despite short die spacing.|重算 1.7 Ω 範例並將厚度加倍。~Recalculate 1.7 Ω and double thickness.
檢查過孔轉接~Check via transitions|過孔電感、焊墊電容及回流中斷形成聯合不連續。~Via inductance, pad capacitance and return interruption form a combined discontinuity.|用剖面追蹤信號及回流換層。~Trace signal and return transitions in a section.
分析順應性~Analyze compliance|聚合物可分散某些應力，但也帶來蠕變和翹曲變化。~Polymers redistribute some stress but introduce creep and warpage variation.|比較剛性與順應中介層的受力路徑。~Compare load paths in rigid and compliant interposers.
控制銅分布平衡~Balance copper distribution|不對稱金屬密度可改變熱膨脹彎矩。~Asymmetric metal density can change thermal bending moments.|比較兩層銅覆蓋率及中性面。~Compare copper coverage and the neutral plane.
判讀 C4 接點應變~Interpret C4 strain|中介層柔性與底填會重新分配 C4 應變，不能只看 CTE 差值。~Interposer compliance and underfill redistribute C4 strain; CTE difference alone is insufficient.|標出角落接點及約束。~Mark corner joints and constraints.
驗證高速通道~Validate high-speed channels|低 RC 不是完整 SI 證明，仍需阻抗、串音及回損。~Low RC does not prove SI; impedance, crosstalk and return loss remain necessary.|比較同通道的 DC 與頻域結果。~Compare DC and frequency-domain results for one channel.
交叉可靠度證據~Cross-check reliability evidence|電性菊鏈、熱循環及界面影像提供互補資訊。~Daisy chains, thermal cycling and interface images provide complementary evidence.|配準失效位置與局部翹曲。~Register failure locations with local warpage.
完成中介層交接~Complete interposer handoff|交付需層疊、焊墊圖、材料版本、模型與驗證範圍。~Handoff needs stack-up, pad map, material version, models and validation range.|列明不能由公開架構圖推定的製造參數。~List manufacturing parameters not inferable from public architecture diagrams.
''')

course(127,'玻璃核心角色~Glass-core role|TGV 與金屬化~TGV and metallization|翹曲與缺陷~Warpage and defects|整合與證據~Integration and evidence','玻璃核心平整度、TGV 與脆裂風險~Glass-core flatness, TGVs and brittle-fracture risk','公開測試載具展示不能等同所有玻璃核心方案已量產；材料組成、TGV 幾何與電性需個別驗證。~A public test-vehicle demonstration does not establish production status for every glass-core solution; composition, TGV geometry and electrical behavior require validation.','假設玻璃與銅的 CTE 差 12 ppm/K、跨距 10 mm、ΔT=100 K，自由差位移為 12 μm；實際應力仍取決於約束、彈性與裂紋缺陷，不能直接由位移得到破壞強度。~For assumed glass-copper CTE difference 12 ppm/K, span 10 mm and ΔT=100 K, free mismatch is 12 μm. Actual stress depends on constraint, elasticity and flaws; displacement is not fracture strength.','玻璃平整就不會產生裂紋~Flat glass cannot crack|玻璃核心代表全部介電層都是玻璃~A glass core means every dielectric layer is glass',['intel-glass','intel-glass-brief'],[('a124','TGV 形貌與金屬填充連到核心功能~TGV shape and metal filling enable the core','核心整合還需增層、翹曲與系統可靠度~Core integration adds build-up, warpage and system reliability'),('a128','玻璃核心可搭配有機增層~Glass cores can use organic build-up','ABF 是介電增層材料，不等於核心材料~ABF is a build-up dielectric, not necessarily the core')],r'''
定義核心與增層~Define core and build-up|核心負責機械支撐及穿通，外側增層負責細密佈線。~The core supports mechanics and through-connections; outer build-up handles fine routing.|將核心和增層分色標示。~Color core and build-up separately.
比較玻璃材料族~Compare glass families|玻璃的 CTE、損耗、強度及加工性隨組成變化。~Glass CTE, loss, strength and machinability vary with composition.|不以單一玻璃數值代表所有配方。~Avoid using one glass value for every formulation.
建立平整度基準~Establish flatness baseline|室溫平整度和熱態翹曲是不同量，量測尺度也不同。~Room-temperature flatness and hot warpage are different measurands.|記錄量測溫度與參考平面。~Record measurement temperature and reference plane.
規劃 TGV 幾何~Plan TGV geometry|孔徑、錐度及間距同時限制金屬化與結構強度。~Diameter, taper and pitch jointly constrain metallization and strength.|畫出最薄玻璃壁與孔口。~Draw the thinnest glass web and via entrance.
檢查孔壁損傷~Inspect sidewall damage|加工微裂可能在後續熱或机械負荷下延伸。~Process microcracks can grow under later thermal or mechanical loads.|區分表面粗糙與裂紋尖端。~Distinguish surface roughness from crack tips.
設計金屬化界面~Design metallization interfaces|附著層與銅的界面完整性影響電阻與應力傳遞。~Adhesion-layer and copper integrity affect resistance and stress transfer.|將電氣連續與機械附著分別驗證。~Verify electrical continuity and mechanical adhesion separately.
估算熱失配~Estimate thermal mismatch|玻璃和銅膨脹不同會在孔口及端面形成局部負荷。~Glass-copper mismatch loads via entrances and ends locally.|重算 12 μm 差位移並說明不是裂紋張開量。~Recalculate 12 μm mismatch and explain why it is not crack opening.
管理邊缘缺陷~Manage edge flaws|脆性核心對切割邊緣與搬運接觸敏感。~Brittle cores are sensitive to diced edges and handling contact.|標出搬運支撐點與可能拉應力區。~Mark supports and potential tensile regions.
觀察熱態翹曲~Observe hot warpage|疊層金屬密度和聚合物固化會影響整包變形。~Metal distribution and polymer cure affect package warpage.|比較升溫與降溫曲線是否遲滯。~Compare heating and cooling curves for hysteresis.
驗證電氣互連~Validate electrical interconnects|TGV 的 DC 電阻合格不保證高速轉接阻抗合格。~Passing TGV DC resistance does not qualify high-speed transition impedance.|將菊鏈與高頻量測分開規劃。~Plan daisy-chain and high-frequency tests separately.
安排破壞與非破壞對照~Pair destructive and nondestructive checks|CT 或光學影像的檢出限須由已知缺陷或截面驗證。~CT/optical detection limits need known defects or section validation.|用相同座標核對孔壁缺陷。~Check via-wall defects at registered coordinates.
評估研究成熟度~Assess research maturity|功能測試載具、可靠度驗證與量產資格是不同里程碑。~Functional vehicles, reliability validation and production qualification are distinct milestones.|用公開證據標註已證明與仍待證明事項。~Label demonstrated and unresolved claims from public evidence.
''')

course(128,'材料與層疊~Materials and stack-up|成孔與導體~Vias and conductors|表面與電性~Surfaces and electrical behavior|可靠度與交付~Reliability and handoff','ABF 介電增層、微孔、銅附著與高頻損耗~ABF build-up dielectric, microvias, copper adhesion and RF loss','ABF 是材料系列商標，不是一種固定通用配方；固化、粗化及製程條件需依供應商版本與專業設備規範。~ABF is a branded material family, not one universal recipe; cure, roughening and process conditions require vendor-version and equipment specifications.','假設平行板面積 1 mm²、間距 20 μm、εr=3.5，C=ε0εrA/d≈1.55 pF；介電厚度 ±10% 對 C 產生約相反方向 10% 一階變化，邊緣場未計。~For area 1 mm², spacing 20 μm and εr=3.5, C≈1.55 pF. Thickness ±10% produces approximately opposite ±10% first-order capacitance change, excluding fringing.','ABF 是導電銅箔材料~ABF is conductive copper foil|粗化越強，高頻性能一定越好~More roughening always improves RF performance',['ajinomoto-abf','ajinomoto-history','ti-si'],[('a126','增層介電與金屬佈線原理可共用~Build-up dielectric and routing principles are shared','基板與中介層的尺寸及機械角色不同~Substrates and interposers differ in scale and mechanical role'),('a127','有機增層可在玻璃核心上延伸~Organic build-up can extend onto glass cores','核心改變會重設 CTE、附著與翹曲問題~A changed core resets CTE, adhesion and warpage concerns')],r'''
辨識 ABF 功能~Identify ABF function|ABF 提供層間絕緣和細線基底，銅才承擔主要導電。~ABF provides interlayer insulation and a routing foundation; copper conducts.|畫銅線與介電層而不混為一層。~Draw copper and dielectric as separate layers.
選擇材料等級~Select material grade|介電、熱機與加工性能會隨產品等級改變。~Dielectric, thermomechanical and process properties vary by grade.|記錄材料版號與資料表條件。~Record grade/version and datasheet conditions.
設計對稱層疊~Design symmetric stack-up|上下層數及銅分布影響固化後彎矩。~Top/bottom layers and copper distribution affect post-cure bending.|比較對稱與單側增層的翹曲方向。~Compare symmetric and one-sided build-up warpage.
理解層壓界面~Understand lamination interfaces|未填滿的凹陷及夾氣會形成局部絕緣和附著缺陷。~Unfilled recesses and trapped gas create local insulation/adhesion defects.|用截面區分厚度不均與空洞。~Distinguish thickness variation from voids in sections.
規劃微孔連接~Plan microvia connections|孔底焊墊、孔壁及孔口幾何共同影響電鍍連續性。~Bottom pad, wall and entrance geometry jointly affect plating continuity.|標示每個微孔對接的金屬層。~Label the metal layers connected by each via.
管理除膠與表面~Manage residue and surface condition|殘膠會阻礙電接觸；粗化與低損耗要求可能衝突。~Residue blocks contact; roughening and low loss may conflict.|比較附著需求與表面粗糙指標。~Compare adhesion needs with roughness metrics.
控制種子與電鍍~Control seed and plating|種子連續性及局部電流分布決定孔壁與線路形成。~Seed continuity and local current distribution govern via-wall and trace formation.|用孔口、孔中及孔底三處驗證。~Check via entrance, middle and bottom.
檢查細線形貌~Inspect fine-line geometry|線寬、截面與間距偏差會影響阻抗、電阻及短路風險。~Width, section and gap errors affect impedance, resistance and shorts.|同時量線頂與線底寬度。~Measure top and bottom trace widths.
估算介電電容~Estimate dielectric capacitance|電容取決於厚度及介電常數，局部薄區可能增加耦合。~Capacitance depends on thickness and permittivity; thin regions can increase coupling.|重算 1.55 pF 與厚度容差。~Recalculate 1.55 pF with thickness tolerance.
衡量粗糙與高頻損耗~Assess roughness and RF loss|導體粗糙可增加高頻損耗，不能只用 DC 電阻排名。~Conductor roughness can increase RF loss; DC resistance alone is insufficient.|比較 DC 與高頻插損的排序。~Compare rankings by DC resistance and RF insertion loss.
追蹤濕熱可靠度~Track moisture/thermal reliability|介電吸濕、微孔疲勞與界面剝離可能交互作用。~Moisture uptake, via fatigue and delamination can interact.|把電阻、絕緣及影像按時間配準。~Register resistance, isolation and imaging over time.
交付基板製造證據~Deliver substrate evidence|材料批次、微孔良率與層疊模型需能互相追溯。~Material lot, via yield and stack-up model need traceability.|列出因材料換版必須重驗的項目。~List checks required after a material revision.
''')

course(129,'局部橋接架構~Local bridge architecture|焊墊與對準~Pads and alignment|電熱機路徑~Electrical thermal mechanical paths|測試與整合~Test and integration','嵌入式矽橋局部細密互連與封裝邊界~Embedded silicon-bridge fine interconnects and package boundaries','本課以公開 EMIB 架構說明局部桥接；不同世代的供電、TSV 及互連能力須看原始資料，不能混稱所有橋接方案相同。~Public EMIB architecture illustrates local bridges; power, TSV and interconnect capabilities vary by generation and must not be conflated.','假設晶粒邊緣長 4 mm、單列有效接點間距 50 μm，幾何上限為 80 個接點；若保留 20% 給接地與備援，剩 64 個資料接點。這不是任何 EMIB 產品規格。~For a hypothetical 4 mm edge and 50 μm single-row effective pitch, the geometric limit is 80 sites; reserving 20% for ground/spares leaves 64 data sites. This is not an EMIB specification.','矽橋等於覆蓋整包的矽中介層~A silicon bridge equals a full-package silicon interposer|所有橋接世代都完全沒有 TSV~Every bridge generation is entirely TSV-free',['intel-packaging','intel-emib'],[('a199','以 EMIB 實例核對局部矽橋架構~Use the EMIB case to inspect local bridge architecture','本課拆解通用整合；案例需按世代解讀~This course decomposes integration; case claims are generation-specific'),('a125','細密矽佈線提供相近互連功能~Fine silicon routing provides related interconnect functions','完整中介層與局部橋的覆蓋及機械邊界不同~Full interposers and local bridges differ in coverage and mechanics')],r'''
比較局部與全面中介層~Compare local and full interposers|局部橋只在需要高密度連線處配置矽互連。~A local bridge places silicon routing only where dense links are needed.|畫兩晶粒間的橋及其餘有機基板。~Draw a bridge between two dies and the surrounding substrate.
分配晶粒邊緣頻寬~Allocate shoreline bandwidth|可用邊緣長與焊墊配置限制資料通道，不只看矽面積。~Available edge length and pad layout limit lanes, not only silicon area.|驗算 80 個接點的幾何例。~Check the 80-site geometric example.
定義橋接界面~Define bridge interfaces|橋兩端焊墊、晶粒凸塊和基板路徑需共同匹配。~Bridge pads, die bumps and substrate paths must match.|對照兩端焊墊圖及信號方向。~Compare pad maps and signal direction at both ends.
規劃埋入位置~Plan embedded placement|橋位置及高度偏差會影響上方晶粒接合。~Bridge position and height errors affect die attachment above.|建立水平、垂直及旋轉容差表。~Build horizontal, vertical and rotational tolerance budgets.
檢查共平面~Check coplanarity|橋區與基板區可能有不同高度及局部剛度。~Bridge and substrate regions can differ in height and local stiffness.|比較同一晶粒兩區的接觸先後。~Compare which regions contact first under a die.
分析細密接點~Analyze fine-pitch joints|更密接點增加對準及短開路敏感度，需統計誤差。~Denser joints increase alignment and open/short sensitivity.|將對準、焊墊及凸塊誤差分開。~Separate alignment, pad and bump errors.
追蹤回流與供電~Trace returns and power|資料經橋不代表全部供電也走同一路徑。~Data crossing a bridge does not imply all power follows that route.|按所研究世代畫獨立供電路徑。~Draw separate power paths for the generation studied.
檢查局部熱應力~Check local thermal stress|矽島與有機基板熱膨脹差形成局部機械過渡。~Silicon islands and organic substrates form local expansion transitions.|標出橋邊缘與晶粒角落。~Mark bridge edges and die corners.
建立通道模型~Build channel model|橋、凸塊與基板轉接都應納入端到端模型。~Bridge, bumps and substrate transitions belong in the end-to-end model.|分別萃取再級聯，核對參考面。~Extract and cascade separately with aligned reference planes.
制定橋區測試~Define bridge-region tests|埋入後可見度下降，前後測試需保留對應關係。~Embedding reduces access; pre/post tests need correspondence.|列橋本體與組裝後菊鏈測試。~List bridge and assembled daisy-chain tests.
比較世代功能~Compare generations|公開新世代可新增供電或 TSV 功能，舊概念圖未必適用。~New generations may add power or TSV features; old diagrams may not apply.|為每項結構主張標注文件年份。~Date each architectural claim with its source.
交付局部橋方案~Deliver bridge proposal|需同時交代頻寬、邊緣利用、供電與可測試性。~Proposals need bandwidth, edge use, power and testability.|寫出相較完整中介層的兩項限制。~State two limitations relative to a full interposer.
''')

course(130,'實體與協定~PHY and protocol|通道與時序~Channels and timing|訓練與錯誤~Training and errors|互通與功耗~Interoperability and power','晶粒間 PHY 通道、時序、訓練及量測~Die-to-die PHY channels, timing, training and measurement','UCIe 是含多層的規範體系；本文教學算例不代表任何版次的強制速率、編碼或時序限制，互通性須依指定版次測試。~UCIe spans multiple layers; examples are not mandated rates, coding or timing limits of any version. Interoperability needs version-specific compliance testing.','假設 64 條資料線、每線 16 Gb/s、有效負載效率 80%，有效單向頻寬為 64×16×0.8/8=102.4 GB/s。線上速率不是應用有效吞吐。~For 64 data lanes at 16 Gb/s and 80% payload efficiency, useful one-way bandwidth is 102.4 GB/s. Line rate is not application throughput.','支援相同協定就保證電氣互通~The same protocol guarantees electrical interoperability|GB/s 與 Gb/s 可直接混用~GB/s and Gb/s are interchangeable',['ucie-spec','ucie-about','ti-si'],[('a129','橋接實體通道可承载晶粒間 PHY~Bridge channels can carry a die-to-die PHY','PHY 規範與封裝橋製造是不同層級~PHY specifications and bridge fabrication are distinct levels'),('a134','眼圖與串音方法可直接轉移~Eye and crosstalk methods transfer directly','晶粒互通還需訓練與版次符合性~Chiplet interoperability also needs training and version compliance')],r'''
分離 PHY 與協定~Separate PHY and protocol|電氣傳輸、連結管理與上層資料語義處於不同層。~Electrical transport, link management and data semantics occupy different layers.|畫出資料由協定到焊墊的邊界。~Draw boundaries from protocol to pads.
標記規範版次~Identify specification version|不同版次及封裝類型可能定義不同能力集合。~Versions and package classes may define different capability sets.|每項宣稱附版次及能力欄位。~Attach version and capability fields to each claim.
計算有效吞吐~Calculate useful throughput|通道數乘線速率還需扣除協定和流量控制開銷。~Lane count times rate still needs protocol and flow-control overhead.|重算 102.4 GB/s 並保留位元位元組換算。~Recalculate 102.4 GB/s with explicit bit/byte conversion.
建立物理通道~Build physical channel|凸塊、線路、轉接與回流共同決定通道。~Bumps, traces, transitions and returns jointly define the channel.|從發射焊墊追蹤到接收焊墊。~Trace from transmitter pad to receiver pad.
分配時序預算~Allocate timing budget|偏斜、抖動與接收建立保持時間共同消耗時間裕量。~Skew, jitter and receiver setup/hold jointly consume timing margin.|將單位間隔切分為各誤差項。~Divide one unit interval among error terms.
分析串音與電源雜訊~Analyze crosstalk and supply noise|同時切換會使受害通道和接收門檻一起變動。~Simultaneous switching perturbs both victim channels and receiver thresholds.|比較單通道與多通道活動。~Compare single-lane and multi-lane activity.
理解初始化與訓練~Understand initialization and training|連線建立需確認時鐘、通道與能力，不只看到資料切換。~Link establishment verifies clocks, lanes and capabilities, not just transitions.|畫出上電到可傳有效資料的狀態。~Draw states from power-on to valid data transfer.
檢查通道修復~Check lane repair|備援是否存在及如何使用須依規範與實作，不能假設無限修復。~Spares and repair behavior depend on specification/implementation and are not unlimited.|移除一通道並記錄可觀察行為。~Remove one lane and record observable behavior.
定義錯誤統計~Define error statistics|零觀察錯誤只提供有限信賴界線，不等於 BER=0。~Zero observed errors gives a finite confidence bound, not BER=0.|記錄測試位元數與信賴假設。~Record tested bits and confidence assumptions.
衡量能量每位元~Measure energy per bit|pJ/bit 需說明功耗邊界與有效或原始速率。~pJ/bit needs a power boundary and useful versus raw-rate definition.|分列 PHY、時鐘及協定功耗。~Separate PHY, clock and protocol power.
驗證跨廠互通~Validate cross-vendor operation|功能互通、壓力條件及規範符合性是不同證據。~Functional interoperation, stress conditions and compliance are distinct evidence.|定義兩端版本與測試矩陣。~Define endpoint versions and a test matrix.
交付連結證據~Deliver link evidence|頻寬、延遲、錯誤、功耗與封裝限制需一起報告。~Report bandwidth, latency, errors, power and package limits together.|寫出未經測試的相容性主張。~List compatibility claims that remain untested.
''')

course(131,'記憶體堆疊角色~Memory-stack role|TSV 與接合~TSVs and bonding|電熱與測試~Electrothermal behavior and test|系統整合~System integration','HBM DRAM 堆疊、TSV、底部邏輯及熱路~HBM DRAM stacks, TSVs, base logic and thermal paths','不同 HBM 世代的通道、基底晶粒與接合方法不同；本課不把供應商某一 MR-MUF 案例當所有 HBM 的共同配方。~HBM generations differ in channels, base dies and bonding; a vendor MR-MUF example is not a universal HBM recipe.','假設 8 個晶粒的獨立良率均為 99%，未計組装時堆疊良率為 0.99⁸≈92.27%；再假設 7 個接合界面各 99.5%，合成約 89.09%。獨立性及已知良品測試會改變此估算。~For eight independent dies each at 99% yield, stack yield before assembly is 92.27%. Seven interfaces each at 99.5% give about 89.09% combined. Independence and known-good-die screening alter this estimate.','堆疊層數加倍必定使記憶體頻寬加倍~Doubling stack height necessarily doubles memory bandwidth|所有 DRAM 層的熱邊界完全相同~Every DRAM layer has identical thermal boundaries',['skhynix-hbm','skhynix-muf','tsmc-cowos'],[('a121','TSV 絕緣及幾何是垂直連接基礎~TSV insulation and geometry underpin vertical connections','HBM 整合還包括記憶體測試與層間互連~HBM integration additionally includes memory testing and interlayer links'),('a132','堆疊熱點與封裝熱路分析可共用~Stack hotspot and thermal-path analysis are shared','HBM 的資料保持與存取行為帶來記憶體限制~HBM retention and access behavior add memory-specific constraints')],r'''
辨識 HBM 層級~Identify HBM hierarchy|DRAM 堆疊、基底介面與外部加速器扮演不同角色。~DRAM stacks, base interfaces and external accelerators play distinct roles.|畫堆疊到中介層再到邏輯晶片的路徑。~Draw stack-to-interposer-to-logic paths.
區分容量與頻寬~Separate capacity and bandwidth|增加儲存層可增加容量，但頻寬還受介面寬度及每腳速率限制。~More storage layers increase capacity; bandwidth also depends on width and per-pin rate.|分開容量、通道數及資料率欄位。~Separate capacity, channel count and data rate.
盤點已知良品資訊~Inventory known-good-die evidence|晶粒測試降低不良堆疊風險，但測試覆蓋不是完美。~Die screening reduces bad-stack risk but coverage is imperfect.|列出裸晶可測與堆疊後才可測項目。~List die-level and stack-only tests.
理解 TSV 垂直路徑~Understand vertical TSV paths|TSV 與層間接合串成連線，任一界面缺陷可中斷路徑。~TSVs and interlayer joints form a chain vulnerable at each interface.|選一條訊號追蹤每層接點。~Trace one signal through every layer joint.
管理薄晶粒搬運~Manage thin-die handling|薄化改善堆疊高度，但降低剛性並提高翹曲和裂損敏感。~Thinning reduces height but lowers stiffness and increases warpage/fracture sensitivity.|畫搬運支撐與自由跨距。~Draw handling supports and free span.
比較接合與模封路徑~Compare bonding and molding routes|不同供應商採不同接合及填充策略，熱與形貌控制需配合。~Vendors use different bonding/fill strategies requiring thermal and geometric coordination.|按來源列出步驟功能，不補造配方。~List process functions from sources without inventing recipes.
驗證層間對準~Verify interlayer alignment|逐層誤差與翹曲可能使邊緣接點先失效。~Layer errors and warpage can make edge joints fail first.|比較中心及邊緣接點的重疊。~Compare center and edge joint overlap.
追蹤熱梯度~Track thermal gradients|距冷卻面遠近與周圍邏輯晶片功率共同決定溫度。~Distance from cooling and neighboring logic power jointly determine temperature.|標出每層功率及到冷端熱路。~Mark each layer’s power and path to cooling.
安排堆疊測試~Plan stack testing|記憶體功能、TSV 連通與電源完整性需要互補測試。~Memory function, TSV continuity and PI need complementary tests.|對每種失效指定可檢出的測試。~Assign a detecting test to each failure type.
驗算複合良率~Calculate compound yield|多個獨立良率相乘會降低總良率，相關缺陷會改變模型。~Multiplying independent yields lowers total yield; correlations alter the model.|重算 92.27% 及接合後約 89.09%。~Recalculate 92.27% and approximately 89.09% after bonding.
檢查系統熱干擾~Check system thermal interference|加速器的熱可影響鄰近 HBM，單獨記憶體測試未涵蓋此情況。~Accelerator heat can affect neighboring HBM beyond standalone memory testing.|比較空載與高邏輯負載溫度。~Compare idle and high-logic-load temperatures.
完成堆疊驗收~Complete stack acceptance|需按世代記錄功能、熱、可靠度與測試覆蓋。~Record generation-specific function, thermal behavior, reliability and coverage.|標明未公開設計細節與教學假設。~Label unpublished details and teaching assumptions.
''')

course(132,'三維熱路~Three-dimensional heat paths|材料與功率~Materials and power|冷卻與控制~Cooling and control|驗證與限制~Validation and limits','3D 邏輯堆疊熱阻、熱點重疊及工作負載~3D logic thermal resistance, hotspot overlap and workloads','熱阻網路是降階近似；3D 堆疊中的空間耦合、溫度相依漏電與瞬態工作負載需要校準模型。~Thermal networks are reduced approximations; spatial coupling, temperature-dependent leakage and transient workloads require calibration.','假設兩層熱源各 20 W，上層到冷端 R1=0.2 K/W，下層到上層 R2=0.3 K/W，且僅向上散熱：上層升溫 (20+20)R1=8 K，下層再升 20R2=6 K，共 14 K。~Assume two layers at 20 W each, upper-to-sink R1=0.2 K/W, lower-to-upper R2=0.3 K/W and upward-only flow. Upper rise is 8 K; lower adds 6 K for 14 K total.','各層溫升都只用自己的功率乘同一熱阻~Each layer rises only by its own power times the same resistance|熱 TSV 越多對所有功能必定越好~More thermal TSVs always improve every function',['imec-3dthermal','imec-soc','imec-cooling'],[('a140','微流道可縮短部分熱路~Microchannels can shorten some heat paths','3D 邏輯還需考慮互連、供電與佈局占用~3D logic additionally constrains interconnects, power and layout area'),('a186','熱梯度會造成封裝機械變形~Thermal gradients drive package deformation','光子系統還需把變形與溫度映射到相位~Photonics maps deformation and temperature into phase')],r'''
標出每層熱源~Map layer heat sources|不同功能區的功率密度不均，不能以整片平均代表局部峰值。~Functional regions have unequal power density; averages hide peaks.|建立各層位置相對應的功率圖。~Build registered power maps for all layers.
定義冷卻邊界~Define cooling boundaries|上、下和側面散熱條件决定可用熱路。~Top, bottom and side cooling define available paths.|明列固定溫度、對流或絕熱假設。~State fixed-temperature, convective or insulated assumptions.
連接串並聯熱阻~Connect thermal resistances|上層熱路可能承載下層累積功率，不能逐層孤立計算。~Upper paths may carry accumulated lower-layer power.|驗算上層 8 K、下層 14 K 的例。~Check the 8 K upper and 14 K lower example.
處理低導熱界面~Handle low-conductivity interfaces|介電、接合層與 BEOL 可能比矽本體更限制垂直熱流。~Dielectrics, bonds and BEOL may limit vertical heat more than silicon.|按各層 t/k 比較熱阻贡献。~Compare layer contributions using t/k.
評估熱點重疊~Assess hotspot overlap|上下熱點對齊可能提高峰溫，錯開則增加佈線代價。~Aligned hotspots can raise peaks; staggering can increase routing cost.|比較相同總功率的對齊及錯開案例。~Compare aligned and staggered equal-power cases.
加入溫度相依功率~Add temperature-dependent power|漏電升溫增加可形成正回饋，固定功率模型可能偏樂觀。~Rising leakage can create positive thermal feedback; fixed-power models may be optimistic.|迭代功率溫度關係並檢查穩定點。~Iterate power-temperature dependence and check stability.
比較單面與雙面冷卻~Compare single and double cooling|新增冷端會重分配熱流，不是簡單把所有溫度除二。~An added sink redistributes heat; it does not simply halve every temperature.|用雙分支熱路重解層溫。~Resolve layer temperatures with dual branches.
安排熱 TSV~Place thermal TSVs|金屬通孔可改善導熱，但占據面積並改變應力和電容。~Metal vias aid conduction but consume area and alter stress/capacitance.|列熱效益與非熱代價。~List thermal benefits and nonthermal costs.
評估工作負載調度~Assess workload scheduling|短熱脈衝與長持續負載利用不同熱時間常數。~Short bursts and sustained loads exploit different thermal timescales.|比較同能量不同持續時間的峰溫。~Compare peak temperatures for equal-energy pulses of different duration.
校正熱感測~Calibrate thermal sensing|片上感測器位置和自熱會影響讀值，未必位於最高溫處。~Sensor location and self-heating affect readings and may miss the peak.|將感測器位置疊到模擬熱圖。~Overlay sensor positions on the simulated map.
驗證降階模型~Validate reduced model|模型需同時重現穩態與暫態，單點擬合不保證泛化。~Models should reproduce steady and transient data; one-point fitting does not generalize.|以未參與校準的負載驗證。~Validate with a workload excluded from calibration.
交付效能熱權衡~Deliver performance-thermal tradeoff|降頻減熱可能降低吞吐，應比較系統任務時間與峰溫。~Throttling reduces heat but can reduce throughput; compare task time with peaks.|報告性能、功耗、溫度及未驗證情境。~Report performance, power, temperature and untested scenarios.
''')

course(133,'負載與電壓預算~Loads and voltage budget|供回路與去耦~Supply returns and decoupling|頻域與瞬態~Frequency and transient behavior|角點與放行~Corners and release','封裝 PDN 的 IR drop、Ldi/dt、反共振及量測~Package PDN IR drop, Ldi/dt, antiresonance and metrology','目標阻抗是設計工具，不代表每個頻率都可用同一標量完整描述多埠供電網路；要匹配負載頻譜及量測參考面。~Target impedance is a design tool, not a complete scalar description of every multiport PDN frequency; match load spectra and reference planes.','假設允許動態壓降 30 mV、負載變化 10 A，初步 Ztarget=3 mΩ；若 DC 路徑 R=2 mΩ、電流 20 A，另有 40 mV DC 壓降，不能從同一預算重複支出。~For 30 mV dynamic droop and 10 A load change, initial Ztarget=3 mΩ. A 2 mΩ DC path at 20 A adds 40 mV DC drop and cannot reuse the same budget.','DC 壓降合格就保證所有瞬態合格~Passing DC drop guarantees all transients|只量電源端就能代表每個晶粒焊墊~Supply-terminal measurement represents every die pad',['ti-pdn','q3d','ti-decap'],[('a137','去耦支路是 PDN 的儲能與阻尼~Decoupling branches provide PDN storage and damping','PDN 還需穩壓器、封裝及晶片負載~The PDN also includes regulators, package and die load'),('a136','萃取提供頻率相依互連模型~Extraction supplies frequency-dependent interconnect models','PI 需要負載時序與電壓容差才有判準~PI needs load timing and voltage tolerances for acceptance')],r'''
分配電壓容差~Allocate voltage tolerance|DC 壓降、動態下陷和漣波共用有限容差，需避免重複計算。~DC drop, dynamic droop and ripple share finite tolerance.|把電壓預算分成獨立欄位。~Split the voltage budget into separate terms.
建立負載頻譜~Build load spectrum|相同平均電流可能有不同 di/dt 與頻譜，供電壓力也不同。~Equal average currents can differ in slew and spectrum.|比較平滑與突發兩種負載。~Compare smooth and burst loads.
設定目標阻抗~Set impedance target|ΔV/ΔI 是初始頻域目標，必須指定對應擾動範圍。~ΔV/ΔI is an initial frequency target with a defined disturbance range.|驗算 3 mΩ 例並列頻帶。~Check the 3 mΩ example and define the band.
追蹤電源與地~Trace supply and ground|回流與電源同樣影響供電回路，地彈跳也消耗電壓裕量。~Returns affect the loop as much as supply; ground bounce consumes margin.|畫完整閉合回路和參考電壓。~Draw the closed loop and voltage reference.
分配焊墊與過孔~Allocate pads and vias|電流分配受路徑阻抗影響，不一定按接點數平均。~Current divides by path impedance, not necessarily evenly by contact count.|比較靠近與遠離負載的接點電流。~Compare currents in contacts near and far from the load.
估計 DC 壓降~Estimate DC drop|IR drop 需包含接觸與熱態電阻，而非只用理想銅線。~IR drop includes contacts and hot resistance, not ideal copper alone.|重算 40 mV 並說明與動態預算的區別。~Recalculate 40 mV and distinguish it from dynamic budget.
建構去耦頻帶~Construct decoupling bands|ESR、ESL 和安裝路徑決定支路有效範圍。~ESR, ESL and mounting determine branch effectiveness.|標示各去耦支路共振與感性區。~Mark resonant and inductive regions of each branch.
定位反共振峰~Locate antiresonance peaks|不同儲能層級可在交接頻帶形成高阻抗峰。~Storage levels can create high-impedance peaks at crossover bands.|對照峰頻與負載頻譜。~Compare peak frequencies with load spectrum.
模擬負載階躍~Simulate load steps|初始 Ldi/dt、電容放電與控制迴路回復是不同階段。~Initial Ldi/dt, capacitive droop and loop recovery are distinct phases.|在波形分段標記三種機制。~Label the three mechanisms on the waveform.
校正量測參考面~Calibrate measurement planes|探針、纜線及焊墊寄生可大於低阻抗 PDN 本身。~Probe, cable and pad parasitics can exceed a low-impedance PDN.|使用已知標準件評估量測底限。~Use known standards to assess the measurement floor.
測試多負載互擾~Test multi-load interaction|共享供電阻抗使一個晶粒的切換影響另一晶粒。~Shared impedance lets one die’s switching disturb another.|施加單邊負載並觀察另一端。~Apply load at one side and observe the other.
交付供電證據~Deliver PI evidence|需包含 DC、頻域、時域與製程溫度角點。~Evidence needs DC, frequency, time and process-temperature corners.|指出哪個角點消耗最多容差。~Identify which corner consumes most tolerance.
''')

course(134,'通道與邊界~Channels and boundaries|傳輸線與耦合~Transmission and coupling|眼圖與測試~Eyes and testing|角點與交付~Corners and handoff','封裝 SI 的阻抗、串音、偏斜與眼圖~Package SI impedance, crosstalk, skew and eye diagrams','眼圖需指定資料模式、等化、負載及量測参考面；板級公式是初步模型，封裝非均勻轉接需場解和去嵌入。~Eyes need defined patterns, equalization, loads and reference planes; board formulas are initial models, while package transitions need fields and de-embedding.','假設 50 Ω 線接到 75 Ω 負載，Γ=(75−50)/(75+50)=0.2；入射 1 V 波在界面的反射幅度為 0.2 V。多重反射及實際驅動源尚未計。~For a 50 Ω line into 75 Ω, Γ=0.2; a 1 V incident wave gives 0.2 V reflected amplitude at the interface, excluding multiple reflections and the real driver.','只要 DC 連通就沒有訊號完整性問題~DC continuity eliminates signal-integrity problems|差分訊號不需要回流路徑~Differential signals require no return path',['ti-si','q3d','ucie-spec'],[('a130','物理通道與時序驗證支援晶粒間 PHY~Physical-channel and timing validation support die-to-die PHY','PHY 還需協定及初始化能力~PHY additionally needs protocol and initialization capabilities'),('a135','控制回流有助减少輻射與外部耦合~Return control reduces radiation and external coupling','RF 遮蔽不能修復所有反射與內部偏斜~RF shields do not repair every reflection or internal skew')],r'''
定義端到端參考面~Define end-to-end planes|驅動器、焊墊、封裝與接收器都屬通道環境。~Driver, pads, package and receiver all belong to the channel environment.|標注量測模型的起終端。~Mark start/end planes of measurement and model.
檢查電氣長度~Check electrical length|是否需傳輸線由上升時間與傳播延遲決定，不只看時鐘頻率。~Transmission-line need depends on rise time and delay, not only clock rate.|比較通道延遲與訊號邊緣時間。~Compare channel delay with edge duration.
建立阻抗目標~Set impedance target|幾何、介電及回流共同決定阻抗，線寬不是唯一變數。~Geometry, dielectric and return determine impedance; width is not the only variable.|比較不同參考面距離的截面。~Compare sections with different reference-plane spacing.
分析轉接反射~Analyze transition reflection|焊墊電容與過孔電感可形成局部反射。~Pad capacitance and via inductance create local reflection.|用 TDR 概念定位不連續。~Use a TDR concept to locate discontinuities.
追蹤差分不平衡~Track differential imbalance|兩線不對稱會轉成共模，影響串音與輻射。~Pair asymmetry converts differential energy to common mode.|比較等長但不同回流環境的兩線。~Compare equal-length traces with unequal return environments.
估算損耗來源~Estimate loss sources|導體與介電損耗具有不同頻率依赖性。~Conductor and dielectric losses have different frequency dependencies.|在插損曲線分辨可能的貢獻。~Identify possible contributions in insertion loss.
檢查近遠端串音~Check near/far crosstalk|電容和電感耦合共同决定串音，長平行段提高互扰。~Capacitive and inductive coupling jointly govern crosstalk; parallel length matters.|保持間距，改變共行長度比較。~Keep spacing fixed and vary parallel length.
驗算反射係數~Calculate reflection coefficient|反射符號與幅度取決於負載相對線阻抗。~Reflection sign and magnitude depend on load relative to line impedance.|重算 Γ=0.2 並改成 25 Ω 負載。~Recalculate Γ=0.2 and then use a 25 Ω load.
建立眼圖判讀~Interpret eye diagrams|眼高與眼寬受雜訊、抖動、ISI 和等化共同影響。~Eye height and width depend on noise, jitter, ISI and equalization.|分開垂直與水平關閉原因。~Separate vertical and horizontal closure causes.
去嵌入治具~De-embed fixtures|連接器與探針可造成測得插損，不能全歸封裝。~Connectors and probes contribute measured loss beyond the package.|核對校正平面與模型埠。~Match calibration planes to model ports.
測試製程與溫度角點~Test process/temperature corners|介電、電阻及幾何散布改變最差通道。~Dielectric, resistance and geometry spread change the worst channel.|比較冷熱及寬窄線角點。~Compare cold/hot and wide/narrow trace corners.
提交通道接受範圍~Deliver channel acceptance range|需同時报告資料率、等化、負載、眼圖及誤差假設。~Report rate, equalization, load, eye and error assumptions together.|列出尚未包含的封裝轉接。~List package transitions not yet included.
''')

course(135,'場源與耦合~Sources and coupling|屏蔽與回流~Shields and returns|縫隙與共振~Seams and resonance|量測與判定~Measurement and decisions','RF 屏蔽導電連續性、孔縫與近場耦合~RF shield continuity, apertures and near-field coupling','遠場平面波屏蔽公式不直接涵蓋封裝近場磁耦合；材料厚度只是因素之一，孔縫、接地及共振需實測。~Far-field plane-wave shielding formulas do not directly cover package near-field magnetic coupling; thickness is only one factor alongside seams, grounding and resonance.','假設同一位置相同量測條件下，未遮蔽電場 1 V/m、遮蔽後 0.01 V/m，SE=20log10(1/0.01)=40 dB；若用功率比則應為 10log10，不能混用。~At the same location and conditions, fields of 1 V/m unshielded and 0.01 V/m shielded give SE=40 dB using 20log10. Power ratios require 10log10.','金屬厚度足夠就可忽略接縫~Sufficient metal thickness makes seams irrelevant|所有頻率和場型都有相同屏蔽效能~All frequencies and field types share the same shielding effectiveness',['adi-shield','ti-si','q3d'],[('a134','完整回流同時改善 SI 與 EMI~Continuous returns improve both SI and EMI','封裝屏蔽是場耦合處理，非眼圖保證~Shielding addresses field coupling rather than guaranteeing eyes'),('a194','遮蔽量測可轉移到高速光模組~Shield testing transfers to high-speed optical modules','光模組還有光孔、纜線及雷射驅動耦合~Optical modules add apertures, cables and laser-driver coupling')],r'''
定義干擾源和受害者~Define source and victim|頻譜與敏感節點決定屏蔽需求，不是只看最高時鐘。~Spectrum and sensitive nodes define shielding needs, not only maximum clock.|畫源、耦合路徑及受害回路。~Draw source, coupling path and victim loop.
區分近場與遠場~Separate near and far fields|封裝內短距離耦合可偏電場或磁場，波阻抗不同於遠場。~Short-range package coupling may be electric- or magnetic-dominated with non-far-field impedance.|標出源尺寸、距離與波長比例。~Mark source size, distance and wavelength ratio.
選定量測量~Select measurand|電場、磁場與接收功率的比值定義不同。~Electric field, magnetic field and received-power ratios differ.|先寫單位再選 20log 或 10log。~Write units before choosing 20log or 10log.
設計導電外殼~Design conducting enclosure|導電表面提供感應電流路徑，連續性影響遮蔽。~Conducting surfaces provide induced-current paths; continuity matters.|畫屏蔽電流如何繞過封裝。~Draw shield-current paths around the package.
檢查接地連接~Check grounding connections|長而窄的接地連線可在高頻呈感性，DC 導通不足以證明。~Long narrow ground links become inductive at RF; DC continuity is insufficient.|比較短寬接合與長引線。~Compare broad short bonds with long leads.
管理穿越訊號~Manage crossing signals|穿過屏蔽的線路可能把干擾帶入，需維持回流與界面設計。~Signals crossing a shield can carry interference inward and need controlled returns.|列所有跨界電源、訊號與光孔。~List every crossing power line, signal and optical opening.
辨識接縫洩漏~Identify seam leakage|長縫可能成有效天線，金屬本體厚度再大也未必有用。~Long seams can act as antennas regardless of wall thickness.|比較等面積小孔與長縫。~Compare a compact opening with a long slot of equal area.
檢查腔體共振~Check cavity resonance|封裝尺寸與介電填充决定共振，屏蔽可能改變局部場峰。~Dimensions and dielectric fill set resonances; shielding can shift local field peaks.|掃頻尋找窄峰並改一個尺寸。~Sweep for narrow peaks and vary one dimension.
分析磁場穿透~Analyze magnetic penetration|低頻磁場屏蔽不只靠導電反射，材料磁性和幾何同樣重要。~Low-frequency magnetic shielding also depends on permeability and geometry.|比較電場主導與磁場主導源。~Compare electric- and magnetic-dominated sources.
驗算屏蔽效能~Calculate shielding effectiveness|場振幅比使用 20log10，功率比使用 10log10。~Field amplitude ratios use 20log10; power ratios use 10log10.|重算 40 dB；僅在兩者具有相同波阻抗的條件下換算功率比，近場 E/H 比需另行驗證。~Recalculate 40 dB; convert to a power ratio only for equal wave impedances, and independently verify E/H in the near field.
控制量測一致性~Control measurement consistency|探頭位置、方向與負載改變會造成假改善。~Probe position, orientation and load changes can create false improvement.|固定幾何並重複拆裝比較。~Fix geometry and repeat removal/reinstallation.
交付頻帶屏蔽證據~Deliver band-specific shield evidence|需報最差頻率、場型、接縫及量測底限。~Report worst frequency, field type, seams and measurement floor.|將低於檢出限結果寫為界限而非精確值。~Report below-floor results as bounds rather than exact values.
''')

